🚢 Titanic Dataset Preprocessing
📌 Project Overview
This project demonstrates data preprocessing on the Titanic Dataset using Python. 
The objective is to clean and transform the dataset into a machine learning-ready format by handling missing values, encoding categorical features, removing unnecessary attributes, checking duplicates, splitting the data into training and testing sets, and scaling numerical features.
📂 Dataset Information
Dataset Name: Titanic Dataset
Total Records: 891
Total Features: 12
Target Variable: Survived
Libraries Used:
Pandas
NumPy
Scikit-learn
